    output is always promoted to inexact.

  Note:

    :func:`jax.numpy.poly` differs from :func:`numpy.poly`:

    - When the input is a scalar, ``np.poly`` raises a ``TypeError``, whereas
      ``jnp.poly`` treats scalars the same as length-1 arrays.
