    Array([0, 0, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 1], dtype=uint8)
    >>> jnp.unpackbits(jnp.uint8(27), bitorder="little")
    Array([1, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 0, 0], dtype=uint8)

    Compare this to the Python binary representation:

    >>> 0b00011011
    27

